      "text": {
        "jp": "ですが、以前の父上には\r\n国のためという大義がありました。",
        "official_en": "But Father’s intentions were always noble, and for the sake of our country.",
        "real_en": "But Father once had a cause he believed in: doing what was best for our country."
      },
